# capture_bulb_image_region.bin — NOT COMMITTED (proprietary Benro firmware)

This file must **not** be committed to GitHub. It is a raw ARM code region
extracted from proprietary Benro / Benro Polaris firmware and is retained only
in the private research repository. Nothing in this repository grants any right
to redistribute it.

